Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,237.6)}{\an7}SPA\N{\pos(371.2,388.8)}{\an7}Evening Discount
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:06.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's an ogre who\Nappears in the sauna at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,An ogre...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:12.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,It'd be a shame to let these go to waste,\Nbut I'm not sure what to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:16.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,First things first, human.\NWhat is a "sauna"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:18.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's a steam bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:23.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,64.8)}{\an7}Easy to loose weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:23.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,475.2)}{\an7}Lots of sweat → Metabolism boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,The idea is that sweating\Nboosts your metabolism,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:23.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,which puts your body in a state\Nwhere it's easier to lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:26.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well... if it means losing weight,\Nthen I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:29.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Besides, French fries taste better\Nafter a nice, hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:31.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that defeat the purpose...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:38.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:35.33,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,568.8)}{\an7}The Sweaty Ogre and\N{\pos(896,604.8)}{\an7}the Turquoise Scales
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:35.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wow, seems I've got the place all to myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:37.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now where's this "sauna" thingy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:41.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh no... Is that the mythical\Nass-dumpling monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:46.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to relax\Nafter a hard day's work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're the one who should be ashamed\Nof showing up at a public bathhouse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:51.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,with that big blubbery belly of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:55.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Blubbery bellies have as much of\Na right to be here as anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:56.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then so do dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.04,0:02:02.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I came here to try out the sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:07.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the sauna, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then what are you\Nloafing around out here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:13.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I-I was enjoying a bath first, that's all...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:14.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:16.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it the ogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:18.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hah, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:21.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're scared of the rumors,\Naren't you? Chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:22.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:25.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's the sauna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go see\Nwhat all the fuss is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.33,0:02:30.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,HOT!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,MY FACE IS ON FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:33.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Th-there's no way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:34.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,120°?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:36.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's a literal inferno...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:38.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,This can't be good for the body, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:40.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I trust the human's judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:42.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'M MELTING!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:45.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Jeez, shuddup already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:49.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Those horns...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're the ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,And you talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:54.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:56.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're gonna let the heat out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's unbearable with the door closed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:01.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Every breath makes my lungs burn...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.63,0:03:04.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Of all the places to run into elves...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:06.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:11.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Just figured it'd be too hot in here\Nfor you wimpy little elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:14.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,For your own safety,\NI suggest pacin' yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:15.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:19.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do not underestimate us elves!\NWe can handle a little heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:20.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:21.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then pick a spot and have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:25.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Already way ahead of-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:28.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,My poor, tender ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:31.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,That was horrible. You tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wasn't a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:35.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Either wrap a towel 'round\Nyour waist or sit on one...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:39.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,So hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:44.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's funny, an elf traveling all the way to\Nan alternate dimension to sit in a sauna?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's not somethin' you see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:49.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,You could say the same thing about an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:51.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you visit pretty often.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're the talk of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:54.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?! Now I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:57.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,No wonder I haven't seen\Nany other customers here lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:01.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,So are your people big fans\Nof saunas or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:03.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Eh, we could take 'em or leave 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:05.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,What us ogres really like is alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:06.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Booze!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:09.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then why spend so much time\Nhanging out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:12.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I mean... it's a free country...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:16.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well, your stomach...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Shuddup, shuddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:19.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for this to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.25,0:04:22.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I just keep drinking too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:24.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:25.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,The human world's booze\Nis too damn delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I see. You've got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, she doesn't! Have some self-control!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:37.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're letting your vices\Ntake over your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I think now is the perfect time\Nto practice exercising patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:43.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,A battle of wills? Sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:45.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,But we might as well sweeten the pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:50.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,How 'bout the winner gets to eat or drink\Nas much as they want on the loser's dime?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.38,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,57.6)}{\an7}All you can eat\N{\pos(512,108)}{\an7}All you can drink
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.38,Q7,,0,0,0,,All-you-can-eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,All-you-can-drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:54.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? 'Cause I'm going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.13,0:04:55.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,So it's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why would you wager food\Nif you're coming here to lose weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:00.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:02.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then let the battle begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:05.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nothin' beats an ice-cold beer after a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:16.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,What did I do to deserve this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,GIMME MY MONEY BACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit being a sore loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Have you no pride?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:24.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Fries over pride forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:26.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's with all the ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,You won't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:30.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,She turned my precious\NFrench fries into alcohol!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:33.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,What? Wait, who even is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:36.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,The name's Oga. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Human! Fries...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.67,0:05:40.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Need fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:41.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,E-Elfuda...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:42.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Just one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll settle for one! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:47.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's way too late to be eating fried food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll start my diet tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.63,0:05:59.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Welp, so much for losing weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:01.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess she needs more coaching...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:05.04,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:03.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.71,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,136.8)}{\an7}Fishmonger
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:08.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,We got some tasty mackerel today, y'all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:08.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I already told you that I'm a vegetarian...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:10.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I already told you that I'm a vegetarian...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:10.71,Q7,,0,0,0,,Our fresh mackerel is a steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:11.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,But not because of a medical condition\Nor anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:11.58,Q7,,0,0,0,,Our fresh mackerel is a steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,But not because of a medical condition\Nor anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can't subsist on French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.71,Q7,,0,0,0,,Watch the shop for me, Mero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Fish is a great option when you're on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.71,0:06:17.00,Q7,,0,0,0,,Yessir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Fish is a great option when you're on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:21.33,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499.2,57.6)}{\an7}Sardines ¥70
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.58,0:06:21.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're rich in protein and\Nomega-3 fatty acids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:24.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,How crass!\NLining up their carcasses like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:26.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,This place is a crass station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:27.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's a "crass station"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:28.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Where you fill up-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:31.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, don'tcha mean a GAS station?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:32.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,You scared me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:33.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:37.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a fishmonger, so I couldn't\Nstop myself from takin' the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now if yer hankerin' for some fish,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I reckon yer mega-serious about\Nthem omega-3s!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.83,0:06:43.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Fish is delicious and nutritious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:48.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Beauty, weight loss,\Nit's got all kinds of benefits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I eat fish three times a day myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.04,0:06:53.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,See how supple it makes my skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:55.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't you mean "flabby"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036.8,352.8)}{\an7}STAB
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,MY SELF-ESTEEM!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Elfuda, that was very rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's alright, she's preachin' to the choir...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:03.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ever since I rolled into town,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:06.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I ain't had much time to exercise\Nor go swimmin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:09.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then I stuff my face with fish\N'cause they're so tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:11.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's a vicious cycle...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:14.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,What the-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,My gills was gettin' dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:24.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,"Gills"? D-does that mean...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:27.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Correct. She is what's known as a "merrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:29.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,In other words, a fish person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:30.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,How'd ya know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:33.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait just a darn minute... Yer an elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:35.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,And I much prefer the term "mermaid"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,"Fish person" sounds like\Na waist up situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:39.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm a fish from the waist down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,My secret potion lets me transform-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.63,0:07:44.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:46.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Feels like the effects are about to wear off...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:47.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:49.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y'see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:51.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,She's a real mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:53.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when\Nthe potion wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:54.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Potion...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,You used merrow tears?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:59.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I've heard it takes ten years\Nto distill one teardrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:02.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well, lucky for me, I discovered a substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:05.46,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729.6,100.8)}{\an7}ORGANIC\N{\pos(678.4,151.2)}{\an7}MACA EXTRACT
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:05.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-you used that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:09.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not sure what it's for, but the ingredients\Nare mostly the same as merrow tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:12.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Plus, a single sip gives me\Nhuman legs for five hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:14.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,That doesn't maca any sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:17.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whaddya think? Ain't it neat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:19.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Could you PLEASE put on some clothes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:22.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ya know I can't go 'round\Nswimming in public as a mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:24.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Them news cameras would swarm me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:27.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,So that's why my biceps\Nturned into a flab fest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well, sure, but can't you just swim\Nwhile you're transformed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:33.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Or find a seaside area\Nwhere there are no people around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:37.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't stand saltwater and I sink\Nlike a rock when I'm in human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:39.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Human bodies are so grueling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:41.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm like a fatty fish that's\Nprime for the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:44.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,The flab on your arms\Nis bothering you, I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Would you like some advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:46.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Muscle loss is the leading cause\Nof flabby skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:54.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, you can get rid of it by\Ndoing sets of bicep and tricep exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:57.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Dumbbells would provide you\Nwith a efficient workout.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:59.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,But if you don't have any,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.25,0:09:01.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,then you can use plastic bottles\Nthat are full of water instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:04.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Even just a little weight\Nwill make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:07.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,There are other exercises like\Nwall push ups that can help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I think I could handle doing those!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:12.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I also recommend a lymphatic massage\Nafter you finish bathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:15.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,as a way to help filter out\Nthe waste from your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:17.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,But bathin' turns me into soup broth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:18.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:19.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can show you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,The human already taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:26.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,For starters, rub your armpits\Nover and over in a circular motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:27.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:32.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then go from wrist to elbow,\Nand elbow to armpit,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,while massaging each area with\Na squeezing motion to make it flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm gettin' the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:39.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,You don't have to squeeze\Nsuper hard, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:41.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's good to make this a daily habit!\NRight, human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:42.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:45.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Have you been keeping up with it, Elfuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:46.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Totally...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:48.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ain't nobody believin' that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:52.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for asking, but why do you\Nspeak with that accent, Mero?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:55.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cause it helps gussy up my character!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:57.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been down south before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:58.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well, that's definitely gonna upset the locals!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:05.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,122.4)}{\an7}Fishmonger
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:04.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Shucks, that lesson of yers was\Nuseful as all get out! Thanks much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:07.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. Let me return the favor\Nwith some top-o-the-line roe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's all yers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:10.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I couldn't accept something so expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:11.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Phooey! Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's gonna expire soon anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:15.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:17.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then I'll happily accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,What are those weird red balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're eggs from a fish we call "salmon".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:23.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you sure they're safe to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.83,0:10:27.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't fuss and find out\Nfor yourself by tryin' 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:29.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ya can't judge foods by their looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.92,0:10:31.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.63,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,57.6)}{\an7}Holy shrimp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oops, those were MY eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:37.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,ELFUDA!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:40.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Just messin'! I hope I didn't\Nkrill ya with my little joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:43.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I need to wash my mouth out\Nwith hot French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hurry and gimme some!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:47.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll go buy some right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.04,0:10:50.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait... why French fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:57.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh my! What an adorable doggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
